\par
\pard\ql\i Description: AI talking avatars and presentation videos.\i0\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_Besides generating videos HeyGen also offers several other features. One of the most useful is the translation element. With this you can upload a video and translate it into a language of your choice.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_HeyGen has a broad range of languages you can choose from.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Quality_The overall aesthetics of the generated videos are very good. Especially when using the translation feature you can clearly see the high quality.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Slow_It can take up to ten minutes to generate a video with HeyGen. Compared to other video generators out there this one definitely takes the longest.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.1.2 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.synthesia.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Synthesia\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.synthesia.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://www.synthesia.io\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw225\pich225\picwgoal1350\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\pard\ql\i Description: AI avatar and video generation platform.\i0\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_There are other features you can use with Synthesia besides just generating videos. A great one is the dubbing feature. This allows you to upload a video and it will translate it into the language of choice.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_Synthesia supports a wide variety of languages.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Less limited_Synthesia offers 1200 credits to start with and refunds some of these credits each month. However the free plan does come with a lot of restrictions on what features you can use.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Slow_Generating a video with this AI-tool can take quite some time.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Moderation_Synthesia has a lot of guidelines and policies. This can cause certain video prompts or video adaptations to be rejected.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.1.3 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.visme.co/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Visme\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.visme.co/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://www.visme.co/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw340\pich343\picwgoal1338\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\pard\ql\i Description: AI-tool to make presentations.\i0\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Style options_You can choose from different templates before the AI generates your presentation.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_Visme supports a lot of different languages. The presentation can be made in almost every language.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Requires login_You need to create an account or sign in before using any features in Visme.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Slow_Generating a presentation can take a few minutes.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Paid features_Many features in Visme are locked behind a subscription. In order to upload your own documents to generate a presentation you need to pay. If you want to import or export your presentations to PowerPoint you also need a paid plan.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_The free plan has a limited number of credits (~ 10 per month) which is enough for creating only a few presentations.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.1.4 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://gamma.app/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Gamma\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://gamma.app/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://gamma.app/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw341\pich340\picwgoal1354\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\pard\ql\i Description: AI presentation and document creation tool.\i0\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Fast_Gamma generates a presentation in under a minute.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Aesthetically pleasing_Presentations from Gamma have modern designs and are visually appealing due to the appropriate use of images.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Comprehensive_If you give Gamma a simple topic such as  common prepositions  it will include all the necessary information such as grammar rules and even exercises.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_Gamma supports a wide variety of languages to create presentations.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_With Gamma you can only create presentations of up to ten slides on the free plan. The app limits users through AI credits meaning that a paid plan is required to create more or longer presentations. This also means that exporting the presentation to PPT is not part of the free plan.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited design control_ With Gamma you don t have full manual customization control. While you can change most of the layout features and edit the information in your presentation. You can not freely place everything wherever you want or edit images.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.1.5 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://prezi.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Prezi\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://prezi.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://prezi.com/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw284\pich177\picwgoal1800\pichgoal1122 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Aesthetically pleasing_The presentations that Prezi create are visually very nice. It doesn t use traditional slide by slide like Gamma for example but it still works as a presentation tool through a zoomable canvas.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_Prezi also supports multiple languages not just English. Privacy_Presentations made by prezi are usually Public by default and you cannot make them private unless you pay.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Privacy_Presentations made by prezi are usually Public by default and you cannot make them private unless you pay.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_The free plan that Prezi provides only features certain elements. You can t make more than three presentations using the AI-tool. Other features such as exporting the presentation or adding an audio fragment are also locked behind a paywall.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.1.6 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.slidesai.io/fr/generate/topic-to-ppt"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul SlidesAI\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.slidesai.io/fr/generate/topic-to-ppt"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://www.slidesai.io/fr/generate/topic-to-ppt\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw351\pich338\picwgoal1402\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Specific_With SlidesAI you can choose to either create a sketch or a fully developed presentation. Before it generates a presentation SlidesAI won t just ask you what language the presentation should be in but also asks you what the targeted audience is and how long the presentation should take. It also asks whether AI-generated images are allowed in the presentation or not.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Goals_SlidesAI also provides a list of the lesson goals that go along with the presentation which is different from other presentation AI-tools.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Aesthetics_When generating a presentation it can happen that some of the slides look very template-like.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_Not only does SlidesAI limit you to one free presentation per account but you also need to pay for certain features when editing the created presentation. For example there is a restriction on how many words you can put on each slide which you won t have if you pay for a subscription.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.1.7 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.popai.pro/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul PopAI\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.popai.pro/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://www.popai.pro/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw463\pich391\picwgoal1599\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Sources_PopAI provides a list of websites it used to create the presentation based on the topic you provided.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_PopAI offers support for various languages.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Slow_PopAI takes a lot longer than most AI presentation tools. It is still a lot quicker than making a presentation from scratch. Compared to Gamma for example PopAI takes a few more minutes.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Aesthetic_Slides from presentations created by PopAI are very text-heavy and will need some adjusting to make them more presentable for students.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_Not only do you have only one presentation you can make each account without paying for a subscription but the free version also has some strict limits. For example you cannot export the presentation and editing is less flexible than with other AI presentation tools.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.1.8 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.presentations.ai/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Presentations AI\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.presentations.ai/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://app.presentations.ai/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw169\pich171\picwgoal1334\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Easy_Presentations AI is very user-friendly especially for people who are used to working with PowerPoint. It is simple to edit images and adapt text.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Adjustable_Presentation AI shows a changeable outline before creating the final presentation allowing you to refine the content first. This helps save time later on.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_Presentations AI can generate presentations in a variety of languages.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Aesthetic_ Presentations AI has a very boring structure and it s the same one for each presentation. The design is quite plain so it s not ideal for students. It s mostly designed for a more formal setting like business-type work.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_A lot of elements aren t available if you don t pay. For example exporting the presentation or the number of slides you can modify. Unlike other presentation AI-tools such as SlidesAI you can create a few more presentations for free.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.1.9 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://slidesgo.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul SlidesGo\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://slidesgo.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://slidesgo.com/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw225\pich225\picwgoal1350\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited_Although with Slidesgo you also have a limit like Gamma or Prezi you still can generate twice as many presentations. The limit on how many presentations and downloads you have refreshes every month.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_Slidesgo supports multiple languages.Editing_ It is very difficult to edit slides. You cannot move images freely and can hardly place text boxes in different positions. The number of presentations and the amount of images you can create in a presentation are limited.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Editing_ It is very difficult to edit slides. You cannot move images freely and can hardly place text boxes in different positions. The number of presentations and the amount of images you can create in a presentation are limited.\line
\par
