\pard\ql\i Description: AI video editing and generation suite.\i0\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_Though they are locked behind a paywall there are a bunch of different features you can use with Runway. For example  video editing  where you can swap the background of a video or change the lighting of the video.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Fast_Runway generates videos and images faster than other AI-tools such as HeyGen or Synthesia.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_Runway provides 1500 starting credits but once these are used up you need to subscribe to continue getting more. Unlike some other AI-tools there is no credit refill system.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Quality_This AI-tool does not follow prompts very well. The quality of the videos is quite poor especially when generating videos that involve real people.\line
\par
\par
