\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_The free version of Pika only gives a small amount of credits but they do refresh monthly. The entire amount of credits is less than what other A- tools like Synthesia for example offer.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Quality_Overall the videos look pretty decent but if you download the video on the free plan the resolutions are not great.\line
\par
\par
