{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw202\pich187\picwgoal1458\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\pard\ql\i Description: Creative AI Image generator platform.\i0\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Advanced_Quality-wise Midjourney is one of the best image generators. It also has certain elements you can add to images such as animation so the images feel more alive.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Options_Midjourney generates four different image variations per prompt by default in order to generate the perfect image. It then allows users to choose the best one and if needed refine it further.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Paywalled_ Nothing about Midjourney is free. All features require a paid plan.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Privacy_Everything you create with Midjourney goes public automatically.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.3.3 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://leonardo.ai"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Leonardo AI\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://leonardo.ai"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://leonardo.ai\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw193\pich138\picwgoal1800\pichgoal1287 }\par}
\par
\pard\ql\i Description: AI art and game asset creation platform.\i0\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Generous_Leonardo AI is a lot less limited than other AI images or video generators. The amount of credits you get to generate something refreshes every 24 hours.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_Compared to Midjourney or Dall-E this AI-tool has a lot of other elements that u can use. For example there is a feature called  real-time canvas  where you can draw something and then it will rework this drawing instantly in a box next to the drawing you made.  Universal upscaler  is another feature that you can use to increase an image s resolution.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Privacy_Everything you create is released to the public when using the free version.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.3.4 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ideogram.ai/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Ideogram AI\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ideogram.ai/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://ideogram.ai/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw332\pich236\picwgoal1800\pichgoal1280 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Options_A similarity that Ideogram AI shares with Midjourney is the fact that it generates four images every prompt you give.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited_ Even though you can only generate a limited number of images based on your credits those credits refresh every week.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Privacy_Images generated with Ideogram AI are visible to everyone.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.3.5 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://openai.com/index/dall-e-3/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul DALL-E 3\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://openai.com/index/dall-e-3/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://openai.com/index/dall-e-3/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw448\pich200\picwgoal1800\pichgoal804 }\par}
\par
\pard\ql\i Description: DALL-E 3 powered by ChatGPT is a strong AI image generator\i0\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Unique_ Compared to most other AI image generators DALL-E 3 is one of the few that offers this kind that can quickly refine images through conversation by giving follow-up instructions such as make it darker or add rain.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_You can only generate a few images per day.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Features_Unlike Ideogram AI for example DALL-E 3 has limited control. Once an image is created you cannot edit it you can only download it.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.3.6 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://openart.ai/suite/home"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul OpenArt AI\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://openart.ai/suite/home"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://openart.ai/suite/home\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw356\pich309\picwgoal1555\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Advanced_Among all the free AI image generators OpenArt AI might be the strongest. It listens to the prompt really well.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multimodal_While you can only generate images for free OpenArt AI also offers audio and video generation features. Unfortunately these are only available if you have enough credits for which you need to pay.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Slow_OpenArt AI can take up to a few minutes to generate an image.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_You only have a few credits to creations images before you need to pay for a subscription.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.3.7 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://yeri.ai/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Yeri AI\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://yeri.ai/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://yeri.ai/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw443\pich228\picwgoal1800\pichgoal926 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Less limited_Compared to other AI-tools you can create up to twenty images before your credits run out. Besides that they also fully reset after twenty-four hours.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multimodal_Just like OpenArt AI this AI-tool can generate images and videos.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Quality_The quality of the images is significantly worse than other free AI-tools such as DALL-E or Leonardo AI.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 1.3.8 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://playground.bfl.ai/image/generate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul FLUX\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://playground.bfl.ai/image/generate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://playground.bfl.ai/image/generate\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw225\pich225\picwgoal1350\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Options_FLUX generates four different images for one prompt.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Less limited_With the free version of FLUX you get to make twelve prompts which is equal to around fifty images.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_Like Leonardo AI this AI-tool also has several extra features. One feature called  expand  lets you increase the size of an image. Another feature called  fill  allows you to select and change a part of an image although the quality is not always very good.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Requires login_You need to create an account before you can use any of the features on this website.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Moderation_FLUX might often refuse to generate certain prompt because it allegedly oversteps certain guidelines.\line
\par
\par
