\pard\sb180\sa180\b\fs30 2.1 Translation support\b0\fs24\par
\pard\sb180\sa180\b\fs30 2.2 Writing support\b0\fs24\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 2.2.1 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.grammarly.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Grammarly\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.grammarly.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://app.grammarly.com/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw225\pich225\picwgoal1350\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_Grammarly supports more than thirty languages.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Quality_Like the name suggests Grammarly doesn t just help with correcting spelling but also with improving your grammar. Next to this it also provides options to make the structure of your text sound clearer. Although the free version has a lot of limits it is still much better compared to other free online writing tools.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_This AI-tool can also be added as a browser extension in Google Chrome which allows it access to your other tabs. This allows you to use it directly in other websites such as Gmail or even you online WhatsApp.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited_Grammarly offers a limited number of AI prompts in the free versions. If you sign up for the Pro version you also get access to a few other useful AI-tools. For example an AI detector.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 2.2.2 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.deepl.com/en/write"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul DeepL\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.deepl.com/en/write"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://www.deepl.com/en/write\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw512\pich512\picwgoal1350\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_DeepL also offers other features such as a voice translator. In addition to that it can be added as a browser extension for Google similar to Grammarly. This way it can help you while writing an email in Outlook or when working on a Google Doc.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Options_With Deepl you can choose the style and tone of text you want your message to be written in. For example academic or friendly.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Quality_While DeepL offers good quality writing support by helping you identify mistakes\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 2.2.3 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://quillbot.com/grammar-check"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul QuillBot\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://quillbot.com/grammar-check"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://quillbot.com/grammar-check\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw179\pich177\picwgoal1365\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_Quilbot has a variety of other features such as an AI detector and a summarizer and so much more. Similar to Grammarly this AI-tool can be added as a google extension to help out with spelling over on other tabs or websites.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Quality_Next to improving and checking your grammar and spelling but it also gives some recommendations as to how to improve the flow of your writing.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_QuillBot only offers a small amount of languages when it comes to the writing assistant. When using the translation feature the options for the languages are almost unlimited.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_Most features on QuillBot are available for free but some are locked behind a paywall such as the paraphrasing options. Other features like are limited in the sense that you can only upload a certain number of characters or generate a fixed amount of images.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 2.2.4 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://languagetool.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul LanguageTool\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://languagetool.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://languagetool.org/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw400\pich372\picwgoal1452\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_Similar to other AI-tools such as QuillBot this AI-tool can be added as an extension to your Google browser. It also allows you to upload Word documents unlike Grammarly for example.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_LanguageTool supports a wide range of languages.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Quality_This AI-tool gives a clear overview of your mistakes and then shows some recommended changes next to your mistakes. LanguageTool  even has a feature where you can rephrase any sentence you select. This feature also gives you multiple synonyms for words to help you change your sentence structure.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_LanguageTool has a limit of 2000 characters per text and you can only rephrase around three sentences before reaching your daily limit.\line
\par
\par
\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 2.2.5 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://paperpal.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Paperpal\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://paperpal.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://paperpal.com/\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw225\pich225\picwgoal1350\pichgoal1350 }\par}
\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Extra_Paperpal also offers additional features such as a plagiarism checker and a paraphrasing tool.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multilingual_This AI-tool supports many languages.Quality_Although this tool supports many languages it is not as accurate as other AI-tools such as LanguageTool or Grammarly. Paperpal tends to overlook spelling mistakes in languages other than English.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Slow_When uploading a Word document it takes about a minute to analyse it while other similar AI-tools only take around 10 seconds to scan the text.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_The AI tool Paperpal has a few limitations in the free plan. For example the paraphrasing tool can only be used up to five times per day. Your word limit for the plagiarism checker is only 7000 characters a month.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Quality_Although this tool supports many languages it is not as accurate as other AI-tools such as LanguageTool or Grammarly. Paperpal tends to overlook spelling mistakes in languages other than English.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Slow_When uploading a Word document it takes about a minute to analyse it while other similar AI-tools only take around 10 seconds to scan the text.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_The AI tool Paperpal has a few limitations in the free plan. For example the paraphrasing tool can only be used up to five times per day. Your word limit for the plagiarism checker is only 7000 characters a month.\line
\par
\par
