\pard\sb120\sa120\b\fs26 5.1.1 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://chat.openai.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul ChatGPT\ulnone\cf0}}}\b0\fs24\par
\pard\ql Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://chat.openai.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul https://chat.openai.com\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
{\pard\ql{\pict\pngblip\picw269\pich148\picwgoal1800\pichgoal990 }\par}
\par
\pard\ql\i Description: Advanced conversational AI from OpenAI.\i0\par
\par\b Pros:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Easy access_Compared to certain AI-tools (Midjourney or Visme) ChatGPT is easier to access because it works directly in a browser on different devices and it doesn t require a login.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Fast_Answers from ChatGPT are generated in a split second.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Multifunctional_ChatGPT is a general-purpose AI-tool with a chatbot that can answer questions and write texts. It can even generate an image and much more.\line
\par
\b Cons:\b0\par
\pard\li360\sa120     Incorrect data_ Answers from ChatGPT are based on training data and may not always be fully accurate or up to date.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Limited usage_ChatGPT has a limit to certain features such as creating an image or uploading documents. They are only available a certain number of times within a limited period.\line
\pard\li360\sa120     Less specialized_ChatGPT is more general-purpose and may be less advanced in specific professional tasks like modifying an image or simplifying a text to certain student s needs.\line
\par
\par
